WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.700
This is Forward Email.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.450
One open-source service

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.350
for email on your own domain.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.200
More than 1.6 million domains already use it.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:11.400
Forwarding,

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.750
encrypted mailboxes,

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:13.600
calendars,

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:14.150
contacts,

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.900
sending and an API,

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.100
all in one place.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.550
Start with forwarding.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.650
Point your MX records at us,

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:23.650
add one TXT record,

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.350
and mail to your domain lands

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.350
in the inbox you already use.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:28.900
Catch-all addresses,

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.950
regex rules and webhooks all

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.250
work on the free plan.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:34.750
Mailboxes go further.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.300
Each one is its own encrypted database,

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.850
opened with your password,

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:40.300
so we can't read your mail.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:41.700
Use any mail app

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.450
over IMAP or POP3,

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.750
with 10 GB of pooled storage.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.600
Sending is unlimited on every paid plan.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.650
Use SMTP or our API,

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:53.550
and your daily limit

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.300
grows with your sender reputation.

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:57.150
Every message is signed

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:58.650
with DKIM and sent

00:00:58.750 --> 00:00:59.950
from IP addresses

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:02.150
with years of sender reputation.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.650
Newsletters work too.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:05.350
Calendars,

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:06.650
contacts and tasks sync

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.450
over CalDAV and CardDAV,

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:09.550
with the same login.

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:13.350
Developers get everything as an API.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:14.550
Inbound mail can reach

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.000
your app as a webhook,

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.800
and DMARC reports arrive parsed and readable.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:20.400
Read your mail

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:21.700
in our apps for Mac,

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:22.450
Windows,

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:23.100
Linux,

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:24.350
Android and iOS,

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:25.250
in your terminal,

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:26.200
or in webmail.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.550
They work offline,

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:28.600
with the local copy

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:31.250
encrypted and locked behind biometrics.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.000
We're the only 100% open-source email service.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:37.700
Every line is on GitHub,

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:38.800
and you can host

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:39.900
it yourself with Docker.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.550
Our security audit is public too.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:44.700
Forwarding is free.

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:45.700
Mailboxes,

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:46.800
sending and the rest

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.350
start at $3 a month,

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.600
with unlimited domains and aliases.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.250
Try it free at forwardemail.net.
